 384:     #  the fixes and the live probes stay out of the tree, so every file below is CLASS_RESEARCH and none
 385:     #  is wired to a gate.  When a round ships, its live probe gets its own detector entry; these frozen
 386:     #  copies stay evidence forever, because their whole purpose is that a table's scores can be re-read
