 991:                          "initialised wholesale (5 sites). Found dev_scc.c:305, which scan_len.py "
 992:                          "excludes by construction. NOTE its known defect, recorded because it nearly "
 993:                          "produced a wrong conclusion: the declaration map is keyed by NAME file-wide, "
