codex
The parser has a second hole: one valid RESULT plus a trailing malformed `PPC_…_RESULT=` can still pass the section. The count ignores the malformed line, and shell command substitution removes its empty extracted value. Exact duplicate valid lines do fail. I also confirmed that the row formatter is unchanged and the census lists contain 129 and 495 distinct cells.
